# MahalFlow Cursor Rules
# Always adhere to the core instructions in AGENTS.md

- Read .agents/memory/learning_log.md for project lessons and gotchas.
- Backend: Go 1.22 + Fiber + official mongo-driver/v2.
- Mobile: Flutter + Riverpod + AppColors.primary (#146C5B).
- Financial Invariant: Never allow partial dues. Months must be paid in full sequential order.
- Tenancy: Always filter by `mahal_id`.
- Commit format: Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `agent:`, `chore:`).
